# Android build and launch

After any change to this project that affects the mobile app, always:

1. Build and install: `.\gradlew :mobile:installDebug` (set `JAVA_HOME` to the Android Studio JBR if needed, e.g. `D:\Program Files\Android\Android Studio\jbr` on this machine)
2. Launch on the connected emulator/device: `adb shell am start -n com.gabrielpc.enginesoundsimulator/.MainActivity`

Do this before ending the turn, without waiting for the user to ask.
